    "detailed_description": "<strong>Worker 42 is a single-player first-person exploration game.<br>Use your scanner to find your way in the interstellar darkness of space.<br>Repair the various systems of the station, complete your tasks and return to Earth.<br>But something seems wrong on this planet.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use the scanner provided by the SCC to find your way in the interstellar darkness of space.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/a9d8de127c700a69071da32ea85df2b1.poster.avif?t=1745945277\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/a9d8de127c700a69071da32ea85df2b1.webm?t=1745945277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/a9d8de127c700a69071da32ea85df2b1.mp4?t=1745945277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Receive your tasks directly on your Digital Mission Assistant.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/a76e5598c6860abe78f427f5719f81d4.poster.avif?t=1745945277\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/a76e5598c6860abe78f427f5719f81d4.webm?t=1745945277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/a76e5598c6860abe78f427f5719f81d4.mp4?t=1745945277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do the job and return to Earth, a routine mission in short, but something seems wrong on this planet.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/f4a4e36d2a52f9b1be9d2849e587fa88.poster.avif?t=1745945277\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/f4a4e36d2a52f9b1be9d2849e587fa88.webm?t=1745945277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/f4a4e36d2a52f9b1be9d2849e587fa88.mp4?t=1745945277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY</h2>You are a worker (registration number #42) of the Stellar Communication Corporation (SCC for short)<br>You have been sent to an &quot;intermediate&quot; planet where an autonomous communication station is installed.<br>This station is a relay of the complex space communication network established a long time ago by the SCC.<br>But lately it seems to be down, no signal has been received for several weeks.<br>After a 79-day journey, you are sent there to do maintenance.<br>The problem is, you have been sent to the nightside of this distant planet.<br>But don't worry, you will be safe, no one lives on this planet.<br><br>The SCC is proud of all its workers and strives to provide them with optimal conditions and quality tools.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Worker 42 is a single-player first-person exploration game.<br>Use your scanner to find your way in the interstellar darkness of space.<br>Repair the various systems of the station, complete your tasks and return to Earth.<br>But something seems wrong on this planet.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use the scanner provided by the SCC to find your way in the interstellar darkness of space.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/a9d8de127c700a69071da32ea85df2b1.poster.avif?t=1745945277\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/a9d8de127c700a69071da32ea85df2b1.webm?t=1745945277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/a9d8de127c700a69071da32ea85df2b1.mp4?t=1745945277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Receive your tasks directly on your Digital Mission Assistant.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/a76e5598c6860abe78f427f5719f81d4.poster.avif?t=1745945277\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/a76e5598c6860abe78f427f5719f81d4.webm?t=1745945277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/a76e5598c6860abe78f427f5719f81d4.mp4?t=1745945277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do the job and return to Earth, a routine mission in short, but something seems wrong on this planet.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/f4a4e36d2a52f9b1be9d2849e587fa88.poster.avif?t=1745945277\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/f4a4e36d2a52f9b1be9d2849e587fa88.webm?t=1745945277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169590/extras/f4a4e36d2a52f9b1be9d2849e587fa88.mp4?t=1745945277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY</h2>You are a worker (registration number #42) of the Stellar Communication Corporation (SCC for short)<br>You have been sent to an &quot;intermediate&quot; planet where an autonomous communication station is installed.<br>This station is a relay of the complex space communication network established a long time ago by the SCC.<br>But lately it seems to be down, no signal has been received for several weeks.<br>After a 79-day journey, you are sent there to do maintenance.<br>The problem is, you have been sent to the nightside of this distant planet.<br>But don't worry, you will be safe, no one lives on this planet.<br><br>The SCC is proud of all its workers and strives to provide them with optimal conditions and quality tools.",
